# CHIME CIRCUIT: the CPU pilots. They fly the same ships, but slower than a
# good player: each has its own top speed for the race, under the ships'
# 560, and each track has its own CPU pace: PRELUDE RING three quarters
# (you can lap them more than once), GRAND OCTAVE the closest. In the
# opening scrum they slash at whoever is in reach. On TWIN FLUE they would
# rather wreck ships than race: two of them hunt.
seed 11
game chime
wait 30
cheat race 3
expect skill0 == 0
expect skill1 >= 370
expect skill1 <= 440
expect skill2 <= 440
expect skill3 <= 440
expect skill4 <= 440
expect skill5 <= 440
botuntil cpu_knocks >= 1 600
botuntil fin0 == 1 30000
expect cpu_laps >= 20
cheat race 1
expect skill1 >= 277
expect skill1 <= 330
expect skill2 <= 330
expect skill3 <= 330
expect skill4 <= 330
expect skill5 <= 330
botuntil fin0 == 1 30000
expect place0 == 1
expect cpu_laps <= 30
cheat race 8
expect skill1 >= 377
expect skill1 <= 448
expect skill5 >= 377
cheat race 6
expect skill1 <= 387
expect hunters == 2
botuntil fin0 == 1 30000
expect place0 >= 1
